],{"_141":156,"_143":157,"_158":178,"_160":179},[],"Engineered timber flooring","c5eeb8a4e4fa",[183],[],{"_141":156,"_143":157,"_158":184,"_160":185},[],"High ceilings throughout","d1b400cc1732",[189],[],{"_141":156,"_143":157,"_158":190,"_160":191},[],"Luxury bathrooms with premium fixtures","0aa3cb82a123",[195],[],{"_141":156,"_143":157,"_158":196,"_160":197},[],"Spacious open-plan living and dining areas","a16bfdc9ac1e",[201],[],{"_141":156,"_143":157,"_158":202,"_160":203},[],"Custom-designed joinery throughout","f507dc13340b",[207],[],{"_141":156,"_143":157,"_158":208,"_160":209},[],"Designer kitchens with premium appliances","494a710e9d4d",[213],[],{"_141":156,"_143":157,"_158":214,"_160":215},[],"Hebel flooring system for enhanced acoustic performance","60427561bf7c",[219],[],{"_141":156,"_143":157,"_158":220,"_160":221},[],"Premium marble and natural stone finishes","2f76a50bd55f",[225],[],{"_141":156,"_143":157,"_158":226,"_160":227},[],"Private residential lifts","9c6b63708095",[231],[],{"_141":156,"_143":157,"_158":232,"_160":233},[],"Contemporary architectural façades","9c4679b1edb8",[237],[],{"_141":156,"_143":157,"_158":238,"_160":239},[],"Approximately 44 squares each","8ff5cb71e915",[243],[],{"_141":156,"_143":157,"_158":244,"_160":245},[],"Two luxury side-by-side townhouses","b11580ffb5c7",[250],[],"h3",{"_141":156,"_143":157,"_158":251,"_160":252},[],"Key Features","df467fc39d11",[256],[],{"_141":156,"_143":157,"_158":257,"_160":258},[],"Each townhouse features premium materials, bespoke joinery, expansive living areas and carefully considered architectural detailing. By maintaining strict quality control throughout construction, we successfully delivered two luxury homes that reflect our commitment to craftsmanship, functionality and timeless design.","724b6453b60d",[262],[],{"_141":156,"_143":157,"_158":263,"_160":264},[],"Siari Build managed the project from concept through to completion, delivering two architecturally designed residences finished to an exceptional standard.","100fe32f7797",[268],[],{"_141":156,"_143":157,"_158":269,"_160":270},[],"Our Solution","a134636c5eee",[274],[],{"_141":156,"_143":157,"_158":275,"_160":276},[],"Delivering two high-end residences simultaneously demanded exceptional project management, precise scheduling and close collaboration between consultants, suppliers and trades throughout the construction process.","4f5357a37777",[280],[],{"_141":156,"_143":157,"_158":281,"_160":282},[],"The vision was to create two luxury homes that offered the space and quality of standalone residences while maximising the site’s development potential. Achieving this required careful planning, structural coordination and meticulous attention to detail to ensure both homes delivered a premium living experience without compromise.","edca02b88ace",[286],[],{"_141":156,"_143":157,"_158":287,"_160":288},[],"The Challenge","988512f026bf",[292],[],{"_141":156,"_143":157,"_158":293,"_160":294},[],"Completed in one of Melbourne’s sought-after bayside suburbs, this development showcases Siari Build’s expertise in delivering architecturally designed multi-dwelling projects that maximise both lifestyle and long-term value.","67a8a1ece2d5",[298],[],{"_141":156,"_143":157,"_158":299,"_160":300},[],"The Seaholme Residences comprise two luxury side-by-side townhouses designed to deliver contemporary architecture, premium finishes and exceptional family living. Each residence spans approximately 44 squares, combining spacious interiors with sophisticated design and high-end craftsmanship throughout.","b7cdaf8c3b4b",[305],[],"h2",{"_141":156,"_143":157,"_158":306,"_160":307},[],"Overview",{"_309":310,"_311":312},"settings",{"_348":349,"_350":351,"_352":353,"_354":355,"_356":357,"_358":359,"_360":-5,"_361":362,"_363":316,"_364":-5,"_365":-5,"_366":316,"_367":368,"_369":370,"_371":372,"_373":374,"_375":-5,"_376":377,"_378":379,"_380":381,"_382":383,"_384":385},"navigation",{"_313":314,"_315":316,"_317":318,"_31